    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eBuy eggs by the three dozen flat.\u003c/strong\u003e This recipe uses a lot of them and the large pack is always cheaper per egg than three separate cartons.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eGround pork is cheaper than packaged breakfast sausage.\u003c/strong\u003e Season it yourself with the smoked paprika, thyme, onion powder and garlic powder you already own and you get the same thing for less.",
